id: pm-j4ac9a
title: "GH-685: extension CommandContext needs portable source and tracker workspace coordinates"
description: Expose canonical repo/source workspace and POSIX-relative tracker coordinates to extension commands so package authors can emit portable host-path-free results and linked-test sandboxes can distinguish source VCS context from isolated tracker storage.
