  "2026-07-25T02:02:10.994Z","harness:codex","Evidence: standard pm get output now exposes tests_count without inflating agent context with the tests collection. Focused CLI assertions, token-budget validation across 14 surfaces, packed-consumer acceptance, and full coverage pass."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:49.102Z","harness:codex","Correction to the immediately preceding evidence comment: this item owns portable extension workspace coordinates. Evidence: CommandContext exposes source_workspace_root, repo_root, and pm_root_rel without leaking checkout-specific tracker coordinates; packed-consumer and package-first acceptance pass."
